<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for vishvaddi.com.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    Most tools on this site run locally in your browser. Files opened in the PDF
    editor, calculator inputs, game records and similar data are not uploaded unless
    a page explicitly says otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2>Local browser storage</h2>
  <p>
    Some features use local storage to remember preferences, saved feeds, game
    records, annotations and tool settings. You can remove this data through your
    browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted by Cloudflare and uses Cloudflare Web Analytics. Cloudflare
    may process basic request information needed to deliver and protect the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Optional Deep Swarm cloud saves</h2>
  <p>
    Deep Swarm can optionally upload its game save to Cloudflare so it can be
    restored on another device. The account uses a generated recovery code rather
    than a name, email address or password. The secret portion is stored only on
    your devices; the server stores a one-way hash. Cloud saving can be disconnected
    or the cloud account and save can be permanently erased from the game title screen.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    If advertising is enabled, third-party providers such as Google AdSense may use
    cookies or similar technologies to select, deliver and measure ads. Consent
    controls will be provided where required.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to news sites, radio stations and other external services are governed by
    those services' own privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:vishvaddi@gmail.com">vishvaddi@gmail.com</a></p>
</Base>
